
 TDIR lists the MiSTer tape library: the PDP2011 core's folder on the SD
 card (games/PDP2011) and the folders below it. Folders are shown as
 NAME/.

   TDIR                    the top: folders and tapes
   TDIR folder             a folder (RSX, RSTS/V9.6, ...)
   TDIR [folder/]pattern   matching tapes (* matches anything)

 Case does not matter. Folders whose names start with _, and folders
 with no tapes below them, are not listed. TLOAD puts a tape on the
 drive. HELP TDIR EXAMPLE shows one.

2 EXAMPLE

   >TDIR RSX
     RSX/11M-PLUS_V4.6/
     RSX/pdp2011_rsx_tools_v101.tap
   1 tape, 1 folder in this folder
